  ✔ Installed 1 plugin on nvme

  ● On the MPC: Preferences → Enhancements (Beta) → Enable Enhancements + External Plugin Support must be on.
  ● Then open a plugin browser: it is listed under External Plugins. If it was already loaded on a track, remove and re-add it (or restart the MPC).

  ● Run the restart command to make the MPC rescan its plugins (unsaved data is lost).

